==Belarusian==
[[image:Elephant Kruger 2003.jpg|thumb|Elephant]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|be|sla-pro|*slonъ}}, possibly a deverbative from {{m|und|*sloniti sę||to lean against}}, relating to а medieval story of а sleeping elephant who leaned against a tree. According to some other sources, it's related to the Turkish {{m|tr|aslan||lion}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Be-слон.ogg|Audio|lang=be}}

===Noun===
{{be-noun|g=m|tr=slon}}

# [[elephant]]
# {{label|be|chess}} [[bishop]]

====Declension====
{{be-decl-noun|слон|сланы́|слана́|слано́ў|слану́|слана́м|слана́|слано́ў|слано́м|слана́мі|слане́|слана́х}}

